        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 5_000_000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.058\n    loan_term_years = 10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    number_of_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n\n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -number_of_payments)\n    )\n\n    # Return the initial monthly mortgage repayment rounded to three decimals\n    answer = round(monthly_payment, 3)\n    return answer\n```",
